From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pi Zero Companion <pi-zero-companion@localhost>
Date: Sat, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pipeline: rpi: ignore Unicam embedded source pad

The upstream Unicam media entity exposes image and embedded-data source pads.
The first source pad is the unicam-image frontend used by the VC4 pipeline;
ignore later source pads instead of rejecting the whole bridge entity.

Signed-off-by: Pi Zero Companion <pi-zero-companion@localhost>
---
 src/libcamera/pipeline/rpi/common/pipeline_base.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/pipeline/rpi/common/pipeline_base.cpp b/src/libcamera/pipeline/rpi/common/pipeline_base.cpp
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/rpi/common/pipeline_base.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/rpi/common/pipeline_base.cpp
@@ -1061,4 +1061,4 @@
 			if (sourcePad)
-				return false;
+				continue;
 
 			sourcePad = pad;
--
2.39.5
